Autofocus, manual exposure and state-keeping patches for libcamera 0.7.2's
software ISP (simple pipeline), applied by libcamera-pro1x after the two
sensor patches in ../.

Origin: moWerk's SailfishOS mainline port of the Pro¹x,
github.com/moWerk/sailfishos-pro1x-mainline, patches/libcamera/, commit
67ee012 (2026-10-30), copied unchanged.
- 0004-0009: Milan Zamazal's softisp autofocus series, posted to the
  libcamera list (Signed-off-by in each patch); 0009 is moWerk's backport
  to 0.7.2.
- 0010-0017: moWerk's (sharpness value, configurable scan, manual AGC,
  AfWindows, gstreamer AfState, refocus rule, crop centring, keeping
  exposure/colour/focus over a camera restart).
Their 0001 (old kernel headers) and 0002/0003 (sensor helpers, ours are
../s5k4h7-sensor.patch and ../imx582-sensor.patch) are not used.
Licence: libcamera is LGPL-2.1-or-later; these patches modify it.  The
source repository states no licence of its own.

The Af block in ../imx582.yaml is moWerk's, measured on their unit.

State: applies cleanly on Guix's libcamera 0.7.2 with our sensor patches
(2026-10-30); build and Snapshot test pending.
